--- A team's task board — Crow's second reference app (session-layer-design.md
--- §4.5). People sign in; boards hold cards; cards hold comments, files and
--- stars; every reader sees another's change as it lands; a log records who
--- did what. Built from the element vocabulary and one widget.
use web, ui
use board.store
use board.page

store.setup[store.book]

serve[3300]
page['/', page.render]
